              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us:</th></tr><tr><td>All tested respiratory viruses (influenza A/B, RSV, parainfluenza 1-3, rhinovirus, human metapneumovirus, and adenovirus) were not detected in the respiratory specimen. These results suggest no evidence of acute infection with the tested viruses at the time of sampling. Correlate with clinical findings and consider other causes if symptoms persist.</td></tr></table></div>"
